1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,000
Nama, Harul Anwar.

2
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:05,950
Nama makcik?

3
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:07,040
Rohana.

4
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:12,080
Saya tanya juga, macam mana acik tahu kedai Hanizah Optometry ni?

5
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:15,040
Oh, acik lalu, nampaklah kan.

6
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:16,860
Acik tengok, Melayu punya.

7
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:20,000
Sebab tu, baguslah orang Melayu tolong bangsa Melayu.

8
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:24,200
Acik sukalah kan, daripada kita tolong bangsa lain.

9
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:29,400
Macam mana servis, penerangan yang kita sampaikan

10
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:34,640
daripada optometris yang cek mata?

11
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,640
Penerangan daripada staf,

12
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,500
acik puas hati tak?

13
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:40,960
Puas hati.

14
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:44,440
Acik pun Alhamdulillah, puas hati, layanan terbaik.

15
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:46,140
Alhamdulillah.

16
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:48,960
Saya tanya juga, cermin mata baru ni okay tak?

17
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:50,980
Okay.

18
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:53,540
Alhamdulillah, acik pun okay.

19
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:54,640
Terbaik!

20
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,500
Okay, nak tanya juga,

21
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:00,000
masa akan datang, akan suggest-kan dekat kawan-kawan, keluarga ke?

22
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:00,640
Boleh.

23
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:04,640
Yes, memang. Dah cakap dengan anak dah.

24
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:10,280
Ada apa-apa tak acik nak sampaikan dekat Hanizah Optometry?

25
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,020
Abang nak cakap apa?

26
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:14,460
Cakap terima kasih ke apa ke?

27
00:01:14,780 --> 00:01:15,960
Terima kasih banyak-banyak!

28
00:01:16,590 --> 00:01:18,920
Acik pun terima kasih banyak-banyak.

29
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,560
Layan acik macam layan anak dengan mak.

30
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:22,640
Alhamdulillah, terbaik!

